						<documentation>The modifiable groups will be shown in a tabbed pane. For each modifiable group a tab will be shown. Each tab will contain a table which shows the locations and
							attributes which can be modified
						</documentation>
					</annotation>
				</element>
			</choice>
			<element name="summaryFunction" type="string" minOccurs="0">
				<annotation>
					<documentation>Used to generate the modifier summary for the modifier panel and run info panel. @ tags can be used to include the (modified) attribute values. Modified values will
						be colored blue. Modified attributes not used in the summaryFunction are automatically appended to the end of the summary. When templates are used specify the summary at the
						template level
					</documentation>
				</annotation>
			</element>
